:: Great Hawk Gifts List
<<effects>>
<<npc "Great Hawk">>

거대 매에게 무엇을 주시겠습니까?
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[선물 주기 (0:05)|Great Hawk Gifts]]>><<pass 5>><<give_gift "Great Hawk">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[다시 생각한다|Great Hawk Gifts List Reconsider]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Great Hawk Gifts List Reconsider
<<effects>>

거대 매가 고개를 돌려 당신을 의심스럽게 쳐다본다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Bird Tower Perch]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Great Hawk Gifts
<<effects>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>>
<<wearProp _gift>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	"I've brought you something," you say.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	"I made something," you say. "Just for you."
<<else>>
	"I've made you a gift," you say. "I hope you like it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $gift is "valentines_chocolate" and $valentines>>
	<<earnFeat "Be My Valentine">>
	You hand the Great Hawk the box of Valentines chocolates.
	<<if $greathawkmonster is 0>>
		<<bHe>> tilts <<bhis>> head, curious, then pecks at it. <<bHe>> soon manages to open the lid, and observes the chocolates within. With care, <<bhe>> lifts each chocolate, and places them aside. Then <<bhe>> adds the box to the nest, tying it in by the ribbon, giving it a place of pride.
	<<else>>
		<<bHe>> frowns, curious. "This has meaning?" <<bhe>> asks. "Forgive me. I don't know human custom." <<bHe>> flips open the lid. With care, <<bhe>> lifts each chocolate, and places them aside. Then <<bhe>> weaves the box into the nest, using the ribbon, giving it a place of pride.
		<br><br>
		"It's beautiful. Thank you, <<wife>>."
	<</if>>
	<<gglove>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 3>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("carnivore")>>
	<<if $greathawkmonster is 0>>
		The Great Hawk looks at it with a puzzled expression. "Strange meat," <<bhe>> says. "Humans hunt strange things. I will take though." <<bHe>> bows. "Thank you."
		<br><br>

		<<bHe>> tears into the meat, devouring it in great chunks. "Very good! I'll try to catch something equally delicious for <<wife>>."<<glove>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>>
	<<else>>
		The Great Hawk cocks <<bhis>> head, as if puzzled. <<bHe>> tears off a chunk of flesh with <<bhis>> beak, and swallows it. <<bHe>> tears into the rest at once, and devours it in moments.
		<br><br>
		<<bHe>> beats <<bhis>> wings in a leisurely way. <<bHe>> enjoyed the meal.<<glove>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Great Hawk" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Return the Favour">>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("drink")>>
	<<if $greathawkmonster is 0>>
		The Great Hawk lifts the drink. "My <<wife>> has strange ideas," <<bhe>> says. "Drink you can carry. Or is it a human thing?" <<bHe>> gives it a sniff, then a sip. <<bHis>> wings unfurl in pleasure.
		<br><br>
		"Mmm! A very good gift!" <<bHe>> downs the rest in one go. "You've made me happy. I'll return the favour."<<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>>
	<<else>>
		The Great Hawk tilts <<bhis>> head, observing the drink. Then <<bhe>> sticks <<bhis>> beak in, and laps up the fluid with <<bhis>> tongue. Enjoying the taste, <<bhe>> lifts the beverage with a talon, and pours the rest down <<bhis>> throat.
		<br><br>
		<<bHe>> beats <<bhis>> wings in a leisurely way. <<bHe>> enjoyed the drink.<<glove>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>>
	<</if>>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Great Hawk" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Return the Favour">>
<<else>>
	<<if $monster gte 1>>
		The Great Hawk frowns at the <<recipe_name $gift>>. <<bHe>> gives it a sniff, then takes a tiny bite. <<bHis>> face scrunches in disgust, and <<bhe>> flings the gift from the tower.
		<br><br>
		"Forgive me, <<wife>>," <<bhe>> says, sounding remorseful. "I'm not used to eating human food. They use too many plants."
	<<else>>
		The Great Hawk pecks at the <<recipe_name $gift>>, lifts it with a talon, and flings it from the tower. <<bHe>> avoids meeting your gaze, as if ashamed.
		<br><br>
		<span class="blue">Perhaps <<bhe>> wants something fit for a carnivore.</span>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Bird Tower Perch]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
